The page structure of this site follows MyMonero's site
(https://github.com/mymonero/mymonero-app-site) and its component system
follows MyMonero's web wallet (https://github.com/mymonero/mymonero-web-js),
both BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2014-2019, MyMonero.com, read on 2026-09-15.

What is carried over is the design those stylesheets state by repetition: the
full-bleed alternating band as the page's unit, the surface ramp (#161416,
#272527, #1d1b1d, #383638, #494749), the text ramp above it, the two-part
elevation recipe (a half-pixel inset highlight over a one-pixel dark shadow),
the 13/12/11/10 px type scale with 0.5 px tracking, the 3 px and 5 px radii,
the 24 px status strip and the label-over-value field row. No file was copied.
css/site.css states those values as custom properties, which the original does
not have, and every component here is written against them.

What is not carried over: the accent colour, which is the one value in that
palette that carries MyMonero's identity; the logo and the wordmark; the
download band and its OS detection; the testimonials band; and the `Native-*`
typefaces, which are a licensed retail family outside the BSD grant on the
source. The type roles here are filled by system stacks and the site self-hosts
no font.

BSD-3-Clause clause 3 forbids using the copyright holder's or contributors'
names to endorse or promote products derived from this software. The MyMonero
name and logo appear nowhere in this site as a badge, an endorsement or a
lineage claim. The block on the about page is a statement of provenance, and
the footer of every page links to it.

